r slower, more deliberate gameplay.&#x22;,\n    type: &#x22;boolean&#x22;,\n    default: &#x22;false&#x22;,\n  },\n}\"\n/>"},"28":{"id":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/configuration-6","page_id":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/configuration#notes","content":"`OutlineColor` uses the same RGBA range (0–255) as `SetEntityDrawOutlineColor`."},"29":{"id":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/configuration-7","page_id":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/configuration#notes","content":"`OneAtATime` only blocks the *start* of a new rotation — it does not cancel an animation already in progress."},"30":{"id":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples","page_id":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples","type":"page","content":"Examples","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Free Resources","filo_bolt"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples"},"31":{"id":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples-0","page_id":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples","content":"Common usage patterns for filo_bolt."},"32":{"id":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples-1","page_id":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples#loosen-a-wheel","content":"Loosen a wheel"},"33":{"id":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples-2","page_id":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples#tighten-after-fitting-a-wheel","content":"Tighten after fitting a wheel"},"34":{"id":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples-3","page_id":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples#passing-a-bone-index","content":"Passing a bone index"},"35":{"id":"/docs/free_resources/filo_bolt/examples-4","page_i